              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mabonyo ghose gha Jeroboamu ubonyere, na kudima kwake, na seji uluye wuda na kujiwunja isanga ja Dameshki na Hamathi cha Israeli, agho gherekoghe masanga gha Juda, ghaandikilo andenyi ya Chuo cha Malagho gha Ngelo cha Wazuri wa Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
